title: "One Shared PPO Policy for Heterogeneous Commercial Building HVAC Control"
abstract: >-
  A single Proximal Policy Optimization policy that controls commercial building HVAC
  systems across unseen building layouts and climates, trained only on the joint comfort,
  cost and carbon reward of the NeurIPS 2026 Smart Buildings Challenge.
